  "label": "audience description",
  "description": "The target community is individuals who are politically aligned with or sympathetic to Donald Trump and his supporters, as the meme explicitly references 'trump supporters be like'. The meme uses the child as a metaphor to infantilize and dehumanize this group, implying their behavior is irrational or childish. The intended audience is likely those who consume political memes and satire, particularly those familiar with the rhetoric surrounding Trump's base and the associated anti-Latino stereotypes. The meme also targets those who are aware of or sensitive to racial slurs and anti-Latino racism, as the text 'fucking mexicans' is a direct racial attack. The audience is thus composed of politically engaged individuals who may be exposed to or share the meme's underlying hostility toward both Trump supporters and Latinos.",
